flowchart LR
  I1("pre-data: panes fixed by design<br/>Assignments 40% · Submissions 60%, reserved"):::blue
  I1 -->|"data lands"| I2("same frame: the 1 row shows inside its pane<br/>the 50 rows scroll inside theirs · nothing outside moves"):::green
